FROM hoj-core:amd64
COPY deploy/local/platform-auth.php /home/judge/src/web/platform-auth.php
# Only the web worker and root can enumerate sessions to revoke an account's
# other sessions; keep the directory private instead of granting world access.
RUN chown www-data:www-data /var/lib/php/sessions && chmod 0700 /var/lib/php/sessions
RUN php -l /home/judge/src/web/platform-auth.php
